5Z","updated_at":"2026-11-24T04:19:25Z"},{"id":785664728,"node_id":"RA_kwDORwA07s4u1ErY","name":"stable-win-x64-update.json","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/json","state":"uploaded","size":200,"digest":"sha256:fe1558e8dc65a5613463897e365f736bb37907e5369ebeef6721bc77d300238b","download_count":171,"created_at":"2026-11-24T04:19:25Z","updated_at":"2026-11-24T04:19:25Z"},{"id":785664726,"node_id":"RA_kwDORwA07s4u1ErW","name":"stable-win-x64-update.json.sha256","label":"","uploader":{"login":"github-actions[bot]","id":41898282,"node_id":"MDM6Qm90NDE4OTgyODI=","gravatar_id":"","type":"Bot","user_view_type":"public","site_admin":false},"content_type":"application/octet-stream","state":"uploaded","size":93,"digest":"sha256:30f4e832a9e05b0c021b754f654258703dc61cfda07f447eb9aace33fb85e247","download_count":2,"created_at":"2026-11-24T04:19:25Z","updated_at":"2026-11-24T04:19:25Z"}],"body":"## Highlights\n\n- **Events open on what is next.** The Events tab and Earnings Estimates list newest first again and open on the next event, not on the oldest row. (#2930)\n- **Tables follow a pane resize.** On the desktop and the web, table columns move with the pointer while you drag a pane edge. (#2916)\n- **Dividend yields on one basis.** `EQS` dividend yield is the forward yield, with the trailing yield as its own `TTM YLD%` field, and `DVD` keeps specials and off-cycle extras out of the forward rate. (#2910, #2923, #2927)\n- **More Asian listings.** Exchange codes such as `IDX`, `KLSE` and `BKK` open the venue they name, and Hanoi and Ho Chi Minh City listings are read too. (#2908, #2919)\n- **Readable SEC filings.** `SEC` and Events previews show the filing and exhibit text instead of raw EDGAR markup. (#2914)\n\n## Also in this release\n\n- `alerts list --csv`: `triggeredAt` is now ISO 8601 UTC (was epoch milliseconds), and every reading carries its as-of. (#2899)\n- Price and move alerts can watch regular hours only. (#2889)\n- Pro quotes stay live after a signed-out read. (#2917)\n- `MEMB` opens `SPY`'s own holdings and exchange listings such as `0700:HKEX`. (#2925, #2911)\n- A plugin that two folders declare loads once instead of reporting a crash at every launch. (#2892)\n\n[Full diff](https://github.com/gloom-sh/gloomberb/compare/v0.20.20...v0.20.21)\n","reactions":{"total_count":1,"+1":0,"-1":0,"laugh":0,"hooray":1,"confused":0,"heart":0,"rocket":0,"eyes":0}}
